direction_22 = location "Undying" about "Undying\nCorpse which has lost volition due to evil energy; undead monster exclusively harboring a hostility against all life forms" found "Burial site vicinity" at 287 891 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, [Sailor] Hayes is looking for you. I think it's another collection duty."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "It's nice to meet you again."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You need to collect something very unusual this time. It's called [Undying Tooth] that comes from the [Undying]. I'm surprised that somebody's looking for such. Well, I don't have high hopes, but good luck.\n\nYou must go in accordance with the request of Karus Regional Executive pugeo port sailors and yes, collected from the Undying Undying teeth."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "It's nice to meet you again."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You need to collect something very unusual this time. It's called [Undying Tooth] that comes from the [Undying]. I'm surprised that somebody's looking for such. Well, I don't have high hopes, but good luck.\n\n[Undying] from [the captain] Aladdin at the request of the port of the Shark Elmo Regional rod-collected [Undying teeth, go."

